  "notes": "USAGE:\nA formal, often medical term. In everyday conversation, {治|なお}る (to heal, to get better) is more common. {治癒|ちゆ} is used in medical reports, health articles, and formal writing.\n\nThe compound {自然治癒力|しぜんちゆりょく} (natural healing power) is widely used in health contexts.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {治癒|ちゆ}する: to heal, to be cured\n- {完全|かんぜん}{治癒|ちゆ}: complete recovery\n- {自然|しぜん}{治癒|ちゆ}: natural healing\n- {自然|しぜん}{治癒力|ちゆりょく}: natural healing ability\n- {治癒|ちゆ}{率|りつ}: cure rate",
